---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How LeadsFlo handles website inquiries, submitted information, and third-party services." path="/privacy-policy/">
  <section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy">
    <p class="section-kicker">LEGAL / PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lf-lede">We respect your privacy. This policy explains the information we receive through LeadsFlo's website and how we use it.</p>
    <p class="lf-legal-date">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-legal-content">
    <h2>1. Who this policy covers</h2>
    <p>This policy applies to visitors of <a href="https://leadsflo.co/">leadsflo.co</a> and people who contact LeadsFlo through this website. It does not automatically cover third-party websites linked from ours or client campaigns managed under separate arrangements.</p>
    <h2>2. Information you provide</h2>
    <p>When you submit an inquiry, we receive the details you choose to provide, such as your name, email address, phone number, business information, selected services, and project description. Please do not submit passwords, payment-card details, medical information, or other sensitive personal information through the form.</p>
    <h2>3. How we use inquiry information</h2>
    <p>We use submitted information to review your request, communicate with you, discuss potential services, maintain relevant business records, and protect the website against spam or abuse. We do not use inquiry submissions as permission to send unrelated promotional messages.</p>
    <h2>4. Website hosting and form processing</h2>
    <p>Our website is hosted using GitHub Pages. The inquiry form is processed by FormSubmit and forwarded to our business inbox. These providers may process technical information necessary to deliver their services, under their own terms and privacy practices. Following external links or viewing externally hosted media may also involve those providers receiving information such as your IP address.</p>
    <h2>5. Analytics and cookies</h2>
    <p>We may use website performance or analytics tools to understand site traffic and improve the experience. Such tools can use cookies or similar technologies depending on the services enabled. Any additional advertising pixels or tracking integrations should be reflected in this policy before activation. You can manage cookies using your browser's settings.</p>
    <h2>6. Sharing and retention</h2>
    <p>We share inquiry information with service providers only as needed to operate the website and respond to requests, or where disclosure is legally required. We retain inquiry messages only for as long as reasonably necessary for communication, business records, or applicable legal obligations, then delete or anonymize them when appropriate.</p>
    <h2>7. Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may ask us to review, correct, or delete personal information that you previously submitted, subject to applicable law and legitimate record-keeping obligations. Use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> to submit a privacy request and specify that it concerns your personal information.</p>
    <h2>8. Security and international processing</h2>
    <p>We use reasonable precautions to protect inquiry information, but no internet transmission or storage system is guaranteed to be completely secure. Service providers may process information in countries other than your own, subject to applicable requirements.</p>
    <h2>9. Updates</h2>
    <p>We may revise this policy as our website or services change. Updates will appear here with a revised date. For questions, please <a href="/contact/">contact LeadsFlo</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
<style>
.lf-legal-content{max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.lf-legal-content h2{font-size:clamp(21px,2.2vw,29px);line-height:1.25;margin:36px 0 12px;color:#17233d}
.lf-legal-content p{line-height:1.85;color:#52617b;margin:0 0 14px}
.lf-legal-content a{color:#315bfa;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.lf-legal-date{font-size:13px;opacity:.75;margin-top:18px}
</style>
</SiteLayout>
